     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Tests for section 3.5 seem reasonable and correct, as of 3-14-2018, when checked against the specification (draft #07) and compared with responses from an actual API (Fedora at d7731a086). There is a slight misalignment of test numbering to the spec (just need label refinement.)   At least one test strategy is questionable and marked as 'unclear', and it just happens to currently be failing against the Fedora API. Conformance has been given correct status in the tracking table at:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
