     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1d08fc4a-d306-416c-9e02-ddbe40b78a7e\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:1d08fc4a-d306-416c-9e02-ddbe40b78a7e\" data-account-id=\"557058:1d08fc4a-d306-416c-9e02-ddbe40b78a7e\" accountid=\"557058:1d08fc4a-d306-416c-9e02-ddbe40b78a7e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Randall Floyd</a>: would you be able to update the label in the test suite per your comment in the wiki:</p>\n\n<p>&gt; Appears to have been moved down into 3.5.1.  Labels should probably be shifted to reflect this as 3.5.1-B.</p>",
